# =============================================================================
# @file web.Dockerfile.dockerignore
# @path deploy/docker/web.Dockerfile.dockerignore
# @project JS web-platform
# @author JS
# @created 2026
# @description Build context of web.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to
#   the Dockerfile). Allow-list: the sources of erp and the image files of deploy/docker - never
#   node_modules / dist of the developer, certificates or .env files.
# =============================================================================
*
!erp
!deploy/docker/Caddyfile
!deploy/docker/web-entrypoint.sh
erp/node_modules
erp/dist
erp/.angular
erp/ssl
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.DS_Store
